{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/new-chair-appointed-to-the-planning-inspectorate-board","content_id":"5d548c56-3345-48c6-a77d-b7144714155b","description":"Housing and Planning Minister Matthew Pennycook has confirmed the appointment of Ben Alexander as the new Chair of the Planning Inspectorate Board.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Housing and Planning Minister Matthew Pennycook has confirmed the appointment of Ben Alexander as the new Chair of the Planning Inspectorate Board. His appointment is expected to commence on 1 July 2026 and run for a period of four years. In addition, the Minister has confirmed a one-year extension to the terms of two existing Inspectorate board members.</p>\n\n<p>Ben will take over from Trudi Elliott, CBE MRTPI, who is completing her second term as Chair. He will lead the Planning Inspectorate as it continues its vital role in the planning system, supporting timely, fair and proportionate decision‑making on nationally significant infrastructure projects, certain planning applications, local plans and planning appeals.</p>\n\n<p>The Planning Inspectorate plays a central role in delivering the government’s ambitions to speed up planning decisions, thereby unlocking housing growth and economic development, while ensuring communities’ voices are heard and environmental protections upheld.</p>\n\n<p>Alongside Ben’s appointment, the Minister has also confirmed extensions to the terms of two existing board members, Adrian Penfold and Oliver Munn, to September 2027, ensuring continuity and stability as the organisation continues to modernise and respond to the government’s ambitious agenda for planning.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Housing and Planning Minister Matthew Pennycook said:</strong></p>\n\n<p>“I’m delighted to confirm Ben Alexander’s appointment as Chair of the Planning Inspectorate Board.</p>\n\n<p>“Ben has a proven track record of effective leadership, commercial expertise and successfully driving through organisation change in the public sector. He will make an invaluable contribution to ensuring the Inspectorate provides timely, high-quality and cost-effective decisions, recommendations and advice.</p>\n\n<p>“I would also like to thank Trudi Elliott for her outstanding leadership over two terms, and to recognise the continued contribution of board members who have agreed to extend their service.”</p>\n\n<p><strong>Further information</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Ben Alexander</strong></p>\n\n<p>Ben is currently Chair of the Industrial Development Advisory Board, an external member of the Cambridge University finance committee and serves as a commercial advisor at the Cabinet Office. He has previously held senior roles in international finance and asset management and brings extensive experience in governance, infrastructure and strategic decision‑making across both the public and private sectors.</p>\n\n<p>For the other Planning Inspectorate board members, biographies are available <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/planning-inspectorate\">here</a>.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:00:04Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"images":[{"caption":"Ben Alexander, Incoming Chair of the Planning Inspectorate Board.","content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19540ac7335e2ca6daacec/s216_Ben_Alexander.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19540a65bc5f798327f4ed/s300_Ben_Alexander.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19540a050971fbebf3bc1a/s465_Ben_Alexander.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19540a916cd732dcdaacda/s630_Ben_Alexander.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19540a59fb7a60f827f4c5/s712_Ben_Alexander.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19540a59fb7a60f827f4c4/s960_Ben_Alexander.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"news_story","first_published_at":"2026-05-29T10:00:04+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/new-chair-appointed-to-the-planning-inspectorate-board","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/new-chair-appointed-to-the-planning-inspectorate-board","base_path":"/government/news/new-chair-appointed-to-the-planning-inspectorate-board","content_id":"5d548c56-3345-48c6-a77d-b7144714155b","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-29T09:00:04Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"New Chair appointed to the Planning Inspectorate Board","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/new-chair-appointed-to-the-planning-inspectorate-board","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1419","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","content_id":"1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649","details":{"acronym":"MHCLG","brand":"ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9ea3c2a28abb50cd88/s960_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9eab418ab055592384/s300_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Ministry of Housing,<br/>Communities &amp; <br/>Local Government"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","base_path":"/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","content_id":"9dbff654-cdeb-4ebe-9a12-cd4cc20a033e","details":{"current":false,"ended_on":"2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00","started_on":"2024-07-05T00:00:00+00:00"},"document_type":"government","links":{},"locale":"en","title":"2024 to 2026 Starmer Labour government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/2024-starmer-labour-government"}],"organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1419","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","content_id":"1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649","details":{"acronym":"MHCLG","brand":"ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9ea3c2a28abb50cd88/s960_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9eab418ab055592384/s300_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Ministry of Housing,<br/>Communities &amp; <br/>Local Government"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false}],"people":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/matthew-pennycook","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/matthew-pennycook","base_path":"/government/people/matthew-pennycook","content_id":"8f439fe5-f799-4fb6-a249-86fd399bb3cb","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-21T13:42:30Z","schema_name":"person","title":"The Rt Hon Matthew Pennycook MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/matthew-pennycook","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1419","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","content_id":"1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649","details":{"acronym":"MHCLG","brand":"ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9ea3c2a28abb50cd88/s960_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/668f9d9eab418ab055592384/s300_2_Marsham_Street_1_-_960x640.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Ministry of Housing,<br/>Communities &amp; <br/>Local Government"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--176","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--176","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-of-state--176","content_id":"6edd9458-f4f8-4388-9fe0-c330422e47dd","details":{"body":"<p>The Minister for Housing and Planning is responsibile for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Planning reform and the National Planning Policy Framework</li>\n  <li>Housing delivery, including large-scale new settlements programme (New Towns)</li>\n  <li>Brownfield Infrastructure Land and Housing Infrastructure Funds</li>\n  <li>Housing supply strategy</li>\n  <li>Homes England and Planning Inspectorate sponsorship</li>\n  <li>HM Land Registry and land transparency</li>\n  <li>Social housing</li>\n  <li>Social and Affordable Homes Programme </li>\n  <li>Housing quality</li>\n  <li>Private rented sector</li>\n  <li>Leasehold and commonhold reform</li>\n  <li>Planning casework</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":25,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-14T14:47:20Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister of State (Minister for Housing and Planning)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--176","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/housing-local-and-community/planning-and-building","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/housing-local-and-community/planning-and-building","base_path":"/housing-local-and-community/planning-and-building","content_id":"e3147d4f-4bd5-4a14-a386-4ba7ccb058b4","details":{"internal_name":"Planning and building (merged, level 2)","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/housing-local-and-community","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/housing-local-and-community","base_path":"/housing-local-and-community","content_id":"4794066e-e3cc-425e-8cc4-e7ff3edb4c39","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"Housing, local and community","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e62-4520-a7fd-6ffd5d3